        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: La Senza, L Brands\n- People: Lauren Gold, Robbie Williams\n- Places: Canada, Columbus, Ohio\n- Topics: brand ownership, franchising, advertising campaigns, music videos\n\nFacts:\n- L Brands Inc., formerly known as Limited Brands Inc. and The Limited Inc., is an American fashion retailer based in Columbus, Ohio.\n- The La Senza brand is currently owned by L Brands.\n- L Brands operates and owns La Senza stores in Canada.\n- L Brands uses a franchise model to operate La Senza stores outside Canada.\n- Lauren Gold is most recognized as the DJ in Robbie Williams's \"Rock DJ\" music video.\n- Lauren Gold also had recurring appearances in La Senza advertising campaigns.",
